#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.global_role_support_manager_res_groups
msgid ""
"This role can supervise and manage all support requests and activities "
"across all areas."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດນີ້ສາມາດຕິດຕາມກວດກາ ແລະ ຈັດການທຸກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການສະໜັບສະໜູນ ແລະ "
"ກິດຈະກຳຕ່າງໆໃນທົ່ວທຸກພື້ນທີ່."

#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.global_role_program_manager_res_groups
msgid ""
"This role has access to all area-specific data to allow for effective "
"program coordination and management."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດນີ້ມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດ "
"ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການປະສານງານ ແລະ ການຈັດການແຜນງານທີ່ມີປະສິດທິຜົນ."

#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.global_role_finance_res_groups
msgid "This role has access to financial data across all areas."
msgstr "ບົດບາດນີ້ມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ານການເງິນໃນທົ່ວທຸກພື້ນທີ່."

# Review needed: Unsure about the best translation for 'universal' in this
# context. 'ຄົບຖ້ວນ' (complete/comprehensive) is used but might need checking
# for nuance.
#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.global_role_admin_res_groups
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This role has universal access and permissions to all system data and "
"features."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດນີ້ມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດແບບຄົບຖ້ວນຕໍ່ກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ "
"ລັກສະນະທັງໝົດຂອງລະບົບ."

# Review needed: Glossary term 'other' found, but target 'ອື່ນໆ' missing
#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.global_role_registrar_res_groups
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.local_role_registrar_res_groups
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This role is allowed to capture data related to their assigned area but "
"doesn't have access to any other information."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໃດ."

#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.global_role_support_res_groups
msgid ""
"This role is allowed to view and respond to support requests from any areas."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ ແລະ "
"ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກພື້ນທີ່ໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. module: spp_user_roles
#: model:res.groups,comment:spp_user_roles.local_role_support_res_groups
msgid ""
"This role is allowed to view and respond to support requests only from their"
" assigned area."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ ແລະ "
"ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການສະໜັບສະໜູນສະເພາະຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

